What supplied detail becomes newly significant.


PAYOFF
What supplied ending now means because of everything before it.


SETUP → PAYOFF LINKS
Which earlier detail earns which later detail.


VIEWER QUESTION
What the audience should subconsciously want answered.


FORBIDDEN SHORTCUTS
What would destroy the accumulated meaning.

